{"id":"2897638221489da5","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-arithmetical-formula.md","title":"Arithmetical Formula","display":"df-arithmetical-formula — Arithmetical Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-arithmetical-formula","aliases":["92-df-arithmetical-formula"],"display":"df-arithmetical-formula — Arithmetical Formula","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]"],"source":"第 IV 章 p. 40（PDF 57）","source_status":"原书无指数算术公式的本地呈现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-arithmetical-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-arithmetical-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetical-formula — Arithmetical Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章 p. 40（PDF 57）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书无指数算术公式的本地呈现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span> (signature of G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithFml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithFml}_G\\)</span> (definition-target arithmetic-formula set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{ArithFml}_G\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{ArithFml}_G\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithFml}\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithFml}\\)</span> : 算术公式集</li>\n<li>算术公式的非逻辑词汇只含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,S,+,\\cdot,=\">\\(0,S,+,\\cdot,=\\)</span>；同时当然还使用变量、逻辑符号与括号 token</li>\n<li>不含额外的非算术谓词、函数或常量符号</li>\n<li>因为本书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span> 恰是这套算术语言，所以系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的全部公式正好都是算术公式，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithFml}_G=\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithFml}_G=\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span></li>\n<li>算术公式可以谈论自然数运算</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书 arithmetic formula 在 L_E 中排除指数函数名，仍有原始 ≤。本文使用仅等式的 G 语言；原书的无指数公式集是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"40c0018b6d45300e\" href=\"?note=40c0018b6d45300e\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-formulas\">92-df-smullyan-formulas</a> 中 Fml_A。指数关系可算术表达依赖 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"75a1feabdeb282fb\" href=\"?note=75a1feabdeb282fb\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1\">92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1</a>，不由“去掉一个符号”的定义推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_G$ (signature of G, see [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula set, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-formulas","status":"resolved","id":"40c0018b6d45300e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书 arithmetic formula 在 L_E 中排除指数函数名，仍有原始 ≤。本文使用仅等式的 G 语言；原书的无指数公式集是 [[92-df-smullyan-formulas]] 中 Fml_A。指数关系可算术表达依赖 [[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]]，不由“去掉一个符号”的定义推出。","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1","status":"resolved","id":"75a1feabdeb282fb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书 arithmetic formula 在 L_E 中排除指数函数名，仍有原始 ≤。本文使用仅等式的 G 语言；原书的无指数公式集是 [[92-df-smullyan-formulas]] 中 Fml_A。指数关系可算术表达依赖 [[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]]，不由“去掉一个符号”的定义推出。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithFml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{ArithFml}_G\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithFml}","display":false},{"tex":"0,S,+,\\cdot,=","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithFml}_G=\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false}],"bytes":1492,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetical-formula]]"}],"outgoing":["5a1bd470754681a7","d666a3e3ee6c8148","40c0018b6d45300e","75a1feabdeb282fb"]}